cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "jmpdata" in publications use:'
type: software
license: CC-BY-4.0
title: 'jmpdata: Input Data and Indicator Estimates from the WHO/UNICEF Joint Monitoring
  Programme'
version: 0.1.0
abstract: Contains two data resources from the WHO/UNICEF Joint Monitoring Programme
  (JMP) for Water Supply, Sanitation and Hygiene. `jmpraw` holds the survey-level
  input data on sanitation that underlies the JMP estimates, collected from the country
  files published on <https://washdata.org>. `jmpindicators` holds the modelled JMP
  indicator estimates for water, sanitation and hygiene from the JMP world file. Both
  datasets are packaged from the JMP 2025 release.
